WEBVTT

01:01.360 --> 01:02.880
Eat up.

01:03.120 --> 01:05.080
You'll be beheaded soon.

01:05.920 --> 01:08.160
Isn't she afraid of killing too many people

01:08.160 --> 01:09.840
and rebel?

01:10.240 --> 01:12.240
Who else will rebel after killing them?

01:19.120 --> 01:20.160
Your Majesty.

01:20.840 --> 01:22.480
What are you trying to do?

01:23.880 --> 01:25.760
If you keep killing,

01:25.800 --> 01:27.320
the royal family will rebel.

01:27.920 --> 01:29.440
The place will rebel.

01:30.360 --> 01:32.080
The Yun Dynasty will fall apart.

01:33.920 --> 01:36.240
How did this happen?

01:47.360 --> 01:49.360
General, we have captured all the rebels.

01:49.360 --> 01:50.560
He Lian Zheng has been captured alive.

01:50.920 --> 01:53.960
A general who died in battle has a thousand households of the Feng army, Zhao Hu,

01:53.960 --> 01:56.039
Qian Xiuzhi, 100 households of the Crane Camp.

01:56.160 --> 01:57.840
Lin Chong, a thousand households of the Tiger Camp,

01:58.200 --> 01:59.840
and General Mu Lie were seriously injured.

02:00.160 --> 02:00.960
Bury them well.

02:01.920 --> 02:03.240
and comfort their family.

02:03.920 --> 02:04.600
Yes.

02:04.600 --> 02:06.160
If Moo-yeol hadn't pretended to surrender,

02:06.640 --> 02:08.639
we would have suffered more casualties.

02:10.360 --> 02:12.320
Young Master, He Lian Cheng is here to see you.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.760
What else do you want to say?

02:35.960 --> 02:38.280
Brother, you know what?

02:38.760 --> 02:40.280
how many innocent people

02:41.160 --> 02:42.640
because of your selfishness?

02:43.680 --> 02:46.120
I just don't want them to be slaves anymore.

02:47.880 --> 02:48.920
What did I do wrong?

02:49.280 --> 02:50.520
Nonsense.

02:52.160 --> 02:53.720
I clearly told you

02:54.920 --> 02:57.480
His Majesty has issued an order

02:58.840 --> 03:01.480
Why did you order them to fight to the end?

03:01.960 --> 03:03.320
Because I don't believe it.

03:05.480 --> 03:06.440
Ji Mingyue.

03:08.320 --> 03:10.160
She's just using you.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.040
Military Advisor doesn't spread rumors.

03:31.520 --> 03:32.720
How could the news be fake?

03:33.160 --> 03:34.520
If you still don't believe me,

03:35.960 --> 03:38.000
I can ask someone

03:38.000 --> 03:39.760
to take you back to Colorless City.

03:40.560 --> 03:42.440
The copy of the imperial edict has been posted in the city.

03:42.720 --> 03:43.520
to announce that

03:43.520 --> 03:45.240
and the whole world.

03:51.120 --> 03:53.520
No one in this world doesn't want gold.

03:54.720 --> 03:56.960
If the Helian Clan doesn't fight back,

03:57.520 --> 03:59.240
there will never be freedom.

04:00.960 --> 04:01.720
Brother.

04:05.440 --> 04:07.160
You're too naive.

04:07.880 --> 04:09.240
Maybe you're right.

04:10.040 --> 04:12.240
Ji Mingyue's order is sincere.

04:13.160 --> 04:14.760
She's not interested in gold now.

04:15.920 --> 04:18.560
Then can you guarantee that

04:18.760 --> 04:22.720
she won't be interested in gold after 50 years?

04:23.960 --> 04:25.560
She's guilty.

04:26.680 --> 04:29.400
No one will truly protect us.

04:31.480 --> 04:32.520
No one.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.480
Man.

04:44.520 --> 04:45.520
You are well-educated.

04:46.760 --> 04:47.760
You've been smart since young.

04:49.159 --> 04:50.360
You should know

04:50.720 --> 04:52.280
the court will change.

04:53.480 --> 04:54.680
War.

04:55.360 --> 04:56.520
peace

04:57.000 --> 04:58.600
there will be a cycle.

04:59.320 --> 05:01.840
But now the freedom of the HerLian family is in front of you.

05:03.360 --> 05:04.640
Why don't you want it?

05:14.320 --> 05:15.320
I'm sorry.

05:16.920 --> 05:17.720
Brother.

05:18.680 --> 05:20.280
I was wrong.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.720
It's my fault.

05:24.160 --> 05:24.960
It's my fault.

05:26.440 --> 05:27.360
for not coming back in time.

05:31.960 --> 05:33.960
I don’t ask for your understanding.

05:35.360 --> 05:36.159
but

05:38.720 --> 05:39.960
Let me hug you again.

05:42.920 --> 05:43.960
Okay?

05:54.520 --> 05:55.280
Give me a hug.

05:58.280 --> 05:59.680
Like when I was young.

06:00.480 --> 06:01.960
When I got sick,

06:04.240 --> 06:05.440
when I was sick.

06:06.880 --> 06:07.680
Then

06:08.560 --> 06:09.840
I won't feel cold.

06:10.360 --> 06:12.440
Even on the way to hell,

06:14.360 --> 06:15.720
I’m not afraid of the cold.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.040
Brother.

07:02.000 --> 07:03.120
Brother!

07:08.680 --> 07:09.560
Your Majesty.

07:14.800 --> 07:16.680
In a few days,

07:16.680 --> 07:19.120
I need you to serve me.

07:20.240 --> 07:23.720
I have something unfinished to do.

07:23.720 --> 07:24.640
I can't die yet.

07:24.640 --> 07:25.480
Your Majesty.

07:26.040 --> 07:28.120
I'll send a message to General He Lian.

07:28.120 --> 07:28.960
Ask him to come back.

07:29.120 --> 07:29.960
No.

07:30.400 --> 07:30.800
But...

07:30.800 --> 07:31.560
No buts.

07:32.480 --> 07:33.640
If you write,

07:33.640 --> 07:35.280
will only disturb him.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.360
If something happens to him on the battlefield,

07:38.480 --> 07:39.720
I will die with regret.

07:41.159 --> 07:42.280
I sent him out

07:43.280 --> 07:44.920
to let him go far away.

07:48.120 --> 07:48.920
Brother.

08:02.800 --> 08:03.920
Man.

08:12.160 --> 08:15.960
As long as the talent for finding gold is still there,

08:15.960 --> 08:17.720
there will be no peace.

08:19.840 --> 08:23.920
The most foolish thing I've ever done is to let Ji Mingyue go.

08:28.960 --> 08:30.080
Brother.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.360
Let's...

08:34.320 --> 08:35.799
die together.

08:37.880 --> 08:39.520
Man, no!

08:41.240 --> 08:42.120
No!

08:42.919 --> 08:43.720
Man.

09:35.960 --> 09:36.960
Report!

09:38.520 --> 09:39.880
News of victory from His Majesty.

09:39.880 --> 09:41.360
General He Lian has successfully suppressed the rebellion.

09:41.360 --> 09:43.080
He will return to the court soon.

09:45.280 --> 09:46.080
Really?

09:52.920 --> 09:54.040
Your Highness.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.560
Don't disturb His Majesty. Let's go.

09:57.560 --> 09:58.160
Yes.

09:59.360 --> 10:01.960
General He Lian has successfully suppressed the rebellion.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.600
Recently,

10:23.600 --> 10:26.560
has anyone visited Huo Ling Yu in the prison?

10:27.160 --> 10:28.320
Yes.

10:28.320 --> 10:30.240
Many of them are scholars from the Imperial Academy.

10:30.640 --> 10:32.640
Many scholars are gathering outside the palace.

10:32.680 --> 10:34.760
to seek justice for Mr. Huo.

10:35.160 --> 10:37.360
All schools are seeking justice for Mr. Huo.

10:37.960 --> 10:40.240
Many people say that Mr. Huo is young,

10:40.280 --> 10:41.320
but he has the dignity of a scholar.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.760
You can't yield to your power.

10:43.360 --> 10:44.200
Pass my order.

10:45.360 --> 10:49.160
Remove the position of Commander of the North of He Lian Jin

10:49.760 --> 10:51.120
and expel him back to Colorless City.

10:52.480 --> 10:54.720
You can never enter the capital without an edict.

10:54.880 --> 10:55.680
Your Majesty.

10:56.520 --> 10:57.320
What are you...

10:58.920 --> 10:59.720
He can't come back.

11:00.960 --> 11:02.240
After I die,

11:02.720 --> 11:04.360
they won't let him go.

11:41.280 --> 11:42.320
Your Highness.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.440
Are you all right?

11:46.480 --> 11:48.360
He Lian Jin is going back to the court.

11:48.640 --> 11:49.720
If he returns,

11:49.720 --> 11:51.400
no one can shake His Majesty.

11:51.720 --> 11:54.320
Even the dethroned emperor Ji Hong Zhen can't do it.

11:55.560 --> 11:57.840
The dethroned emperor is no match for you.

11:58.040 --> 11:59.520
A good fowl chooses wood to live.

11:59.680 --> 12:00.960
Do you understand

12:02.160 --> 12:03.960
what you want me to do?

12:04.120 --> 12:05.640
Although the dethroned emperor is useless,

12:05.680 --> 12:07.360
he can still use it.

12:07.720 --> 12:10.320
We must fight for Mr. Huo's support.

12:10.320 --> 12:12.480
Although he may hesitate,

12:12.520 --> 12:14.320
but my mother is tough.

12:14.480 --> 12:16.720
We just need to find the right time

12:17.040 --> 12:18.160
and make it bigger,

12:18.440 --> 12:20.360
he will be on our side.

12:20.680 --> 12:23.960
Besides, you have to stop He Lian Jin and kill him.

12:24.040 --> 12:25.840
In this way, your grandson

12:25.840 --> 12:27.360
will become my study partner.

12:28.160 --> 12:31.360
You secretly raised a foreigner and colluded with Baili Jinghong

12:31.360 --> 12:32.520
and colluded with Baili Jinghong.

12:34.960 --> 12:36.240
You're already the Crown Prince.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.640
Why bother?

12:38.520 --> 12:41.240
You're quite curious.

12:46.160 --> 12:48.160
I understand.

12:56.320 --> 12:58.760
Your Majesty, Lord Huo's letter of apology from the Ministry of Justice.

12:59.400 --> 13:00.680
Bring it to me.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.640
Guards!

13:21.640 --> 13:23.520
Bring Lord Huo to the palace to see me.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.880
Sir, what are you...

13:39.960 --> 13:41.120
The magical jade.

13:41.120 --> 13:43.960
You're the only one who can save Liao now.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.920
I believe in your eyes and promises.

13:47.360 --> 13:48.760
to help the empress ascend the throne,

13:48.840 --> 13:51.560
in exchange for the glory of the imperial court.

13:54.200 --> 13:54.960
Forget it.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.720
Let's cut to the chase.

13:57.240 --> 13:59.240
But the new emperor is so violent.

13:59.560 --> 14:00.120
I'm afraid...

14:00.120 --> 14:00.840
Master, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.280
Who is innocent?

14:03.360 --> 14:05.720
His Majesty is just a little aggressive.

14:05.760 --> 14:06.960
and confused.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.560
I'm sure he'll come to his senses.

14:09.760 --> 14:11.160
His Highness said

14:11.440 --> 14:13.680
she wants to order to kill a group of officials.

14:13.680 --> 14:14.760
If this continues,

14:14.760 --> 14:16.520
Dayin will be in danger.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.960
Please help the people

14:18.960 --> 14:20.640
for the people of Liao.

14:21.120 --> 14:22.960
Although I was confused for a moment,

14:23.160 --> 14:24.560
But if this continues,

14:24.760 --> 14:26.160
we'll be doomed.

14:26.440 --> 14:28.160
This must not be my original intention.

14:28.320 --> 14:29.160
That's right.

14:29.520 --> 14:32.520
You and His Majesty watched the Crown Prince grow up.

14:32.520 --> 14:34.880
You know his character best.

14:35.520 --> 14:38.360
Even if he returns to the Ji royal family,

14:38.440 --> 14:41.840
the Crown Prince will protect His Majesty.

14:43.280 --> 14:44.080
You just need to...

14:59.560 --> 15:00.360
Young Master.

15:00.920 --> 15:02.320
You shouldn’t have been injured.

15:02.680 --> 15:04.640
Besides, she's removed from your position as General.

15:04.680 --> 15:05.720
She forbids you to return to the capital.

15:06.040 --> 15:08.520
You'll die if you go back like this.

15:09.520 --> 15:10.520
It doesn’t matter.

15:10.520 --> 15:11.840
Man’s stab is not fatal.

15:12.400 --> 15:13.800
But the poison is a bit tricky.

15:13.800 --> 15:15.280
It's spring

15:15.600 --> 15:16.600
It's spring.

15:16.800 --> 15:18.560
There's another reason why she doesn't let me go back.

15:18.760 --> 15:19.840
She's in danger.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.880
I can't leave her in the capital.

15:24.920 --> 15:25.720
Hya!

15:30.560 --> 15:31.360
Lunar.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.040
Wait for me.

15:44.120 --> 15:45.240
You don't want to persuade me?

15:46.680 --> 15:47.720
I want to persuade him.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.440
But I understand

15:50.440 --> 15:51.440
I understand.

16:08.360 --> 16:09.640
Have some tea.

16:09.920 --> 16:11.680
We'll have a talk tonight.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.400
You don't think

16:19.400 --> 16:21.280
I will poison you with a cup of tea?

16:40.520 --> 16:41.680
I'm not as pretty as you.

16:43.680 --> 16:45.520
What do you want to talk to me about?
